<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 13.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- New Polish, Indian ambassadors present their credential letters to President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali.</p>
<p>- New school year to start next Monday. A quarter of Tunisia's population to go primary and secondary schools.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisian Transports Minister Sadok Rabeh says he is considering setting up new legislation on international transport.</p>
